<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
    <title>Confirme sua conta no SmartReport</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f1f5f9; color:#0f172a; font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%; background-color:#f1f5f9;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%; max-width:600px;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding:0 4px 20px;">
                        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" valign="middle" width="44" height="44" style="width:44px; height:44px; background-color:#0f766e; border-radius:12px; color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.5px;">SR</td>
                                <td style="padding-left:12px;">
                                    <div style="color:#0f172a; font-size:18px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.4px;">Smart<span style="color:#0f9f91;">Report</span></div>
                                    <div style="padding-top:2px; color:#64748b; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1.4px; text-transform:uppercase;">Report workspace</div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="overflow:hidden; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:18px; box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);">
                        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                            <tr>
                                <td height="6" style="height:6px; background-color:#14b8a6; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:46px 48px 18px;">
                                    <div style="display:inline-block; padding:7px 11px; background-color:#f0fdfa; border:1px solid #99f6e4; border-radius:999px; color:#0f766e; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-transform:uppercase;">Última etapa</div>
                                    <h1 style="margin:22px 0 12px; color:#0f172a; font-size:30px; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-1px;">Confirme seu endereço de e-mail</h1>
                                    <p style="margin:0; color:#475569; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75;">Seu workspace SmartReport está quase pronto. Confirme seu e-mail para ativar a conta e começar a criar relatórios profissionais.</p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:18px 48px 12px;">
                                    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td align="center" style="background-color:#0f766e; border-radius:999px; box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(15,118,110,0.22);">
                                                <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block; padding:15px 28px; color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; font-weight:800; line-height:1; text-decoration:none;">Confirmar minha conta&nbsp;&nbsp;→</a>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:18px 48px 42px;">
                                    <p style="margin:0 0 9px; color:#64748b; font-size:12px; line-height:1.6;">Se o botão não funcionar, copie e cole este endereço no navegador:</p>
                                    <p style="margin:0; padding:12px 14px; overflow-wrap:anywhere; background-color:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:9px; color:#0f766e; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6;"><a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" style="color:#0f766e; text-decoration:none;">{{url}}</a></p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:22px 48px; background-color:#f8fafc; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                                    <p style="margin:0; color:#64748b; font-size:12px; line-height:1.7;">Não criou uma conta no SmartReport? Ignore esta mensagem com segurança.</p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding:22px 20px 0; color:#94a3b8; font-size:11px; line-height:1.7;">
                        SmartReport, um produto SmartVerse<br>
                        <a href="https://smartverse.com.br" style="color:#64748b; text-decoration:none;">smartverse.com.br</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
